/rb><rt>きら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88504-88551">はれたものでなければならない。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88554-88569"><rb>麻</rb><rt>あさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88569-88572">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88572-88584"><rb>刈</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88584-88590">ると</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88590-88605"><rb>題</rb><rt>だい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88605-88617">したが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88617-88632"><rb>紡</rb><rt>つむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88632-88635">ぎ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88635-88647"><rb>織</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88647-88650">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88650-88662"><rb>縫</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88662-88686">ひもせぬ、これは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88686-88707"><rb>浴衣</rb><rt>ゆかた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88707-88716">がけの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-88716-88752"><rb>縁臺話</rb><rt>えんだいばなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-88752-88763">。――</seg></p>
